---
title: "Jan Gan Man"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "C"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

[C]Jana gana mana adhi [Am]naayaka jaya [F]he

[C]Bhaarata [G]bhaagya vi [F]dhaa [C]ta

Pun [C]jaab Sindhu Guja [Am]raata Maraatha

[F]Draavida Utkala [G]Ban [C]ga

[C]Vindhya Himaachala [G]Yamuna [F]Ganga

[C]Uchhala [G]Jaladhi ta [F]ran [C]ga

[C]Tava shubha naame [Am]jaa [F]ge,

[G]tava shubha aashish [F]maan [C]ge

[Am]Gaaye [G]tava jaya [F]gaa [C]tha

[C]Jana gana mangala [G]daayaka jaya he

[F]Bhaarata bhaagya vi [G]dhaa [C]ta

Jaya [Am]he, jaya [G]he, jaya [F]he,

[C]jaya jaya [Am]jaya jaya [F]he
